WEBVTT

00:09:30.123 --> 00:09:32.513
Whether you're trying
to build your own walls,

00:09:32.513 --> 00:09:35.306
keep out what you don't want,
keep in what you do,

00:09:35.306 --> 00:09:36.545
hold in your pride,

00:09:36.545 --> 00:09:38.323
keep out competition,

00:09:38.323 --> 00:09:41.544
all those things
are going to happen anyway.

00:09:42.064 --> 00:09:43.844
The world is flat.

00:09:43.844 --> 00:09:45.284
It's flat!

00:09:45.584 --> 00:09:47.854
But it's tilted toward China now.

00:09:47.854 --> 00:09:49.294
(Laughter)

00:09:49.752 --> 00:09:51.286
And I can assure you,

00:09:51.286 --> 00:09:55.695
we Chinese millennials are ready to be
the explorers in this new adventure

00:09:55.695 --> 00:09:57.515
from the Far East.

00:09:57.515 --> 00:09:58.632
Thank you.

00:09:58.632 --> 00:10:01.006
(Applause) (Cheers)